2,1,,status,Minato,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,We should be careful about the financial implications of this move. I suggest we look into the floor billing and the facilities quote first.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,I wonder if the desks are comfortable for everyone. Maybe we can check the physio's notes and the sound levels?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'm more worried about how this affects our actual flow. I want to know about the morning routines and the badge records.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's not forget that some seats are objectively worse than others. I'll look into the staff survey and the past shuffles to see who's been stuck where.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I think... maybe we should see how people actually interact. I'd like to know about the project strands and what the new joiners felt.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Minato, sound levels are important, but costs are the primary constraint. We can't ignore the budget.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I understand, Victoria. I just think if we feel tired or it's too noisy, we might not work as well.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"Exactly! Efficiency is key. If we spend twenty minutes just getting settled every morning, we're losing precious time.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Efficiency is a fine goal, May, but let's be honest: some of us will end up in the drafty corner. We need a fair way to handle that.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with Shunichi. I just hope we can sit in a way that makes it easier to talk to each other.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"Fairness is a valid point, but it must be balanced with the budget. Let's ensure we have the hard numbers before we decide on a layout.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'm curious about how the people upstairs do it. Do they have special chairs or something?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, that's why I'm checking the morning routine! I bet they have a system that doesn't waste time.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"A ""system"" usually just means someone else is doing the heavy lifting. I'm more interested in the history of who got moved and why.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I just... I don't want to be isolated. I think knowing about the project strands might help us place people who actually need to talk.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Victoria,,It seems we have a broad range of interests. Let's proceed with these investigations so we can make a rational choice.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Minato,,Okay. I hope we can find a way to make everyone feel comfortable.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,"As long as it doesn't turn into a morning chore, I'm on board. Let's get the data.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll be watching to make sure we don't just let the ""natural order"" decide who gets the worst desk.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,Okay... I'll do my best to help.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
